reen_2560x1440_.png", "id": "3314433392109438", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75348041_3314433395442771_2202454263537393708_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=meFOLB3mF2IQ7kNvwHdCNkG&_nc_oc=Adpo4m-oVP89msY6qhaHVIa3nxJ1Tt2h0AqaL-4GFA0knd4G0bQa6XTVVgt-Q4PR_qs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDuirX1RA49RslvzbsIeeASb--lRfxjVABlozbM0HERiA&oe=6A58F6A3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560.png", "id": "816547639394412", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035322_816547642727745_7998601187497381217_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5LFc_hCGvCgQ7kNvwFwJP2R&_nc_oc=AdpLwFrk6AmtRs4sLJYFWLlk7DgvszUnFU_vwvETaLX66B983Euwj_PXEUicmLDOXCw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQChYHfBp2iXjom3fgvE24VOW1zDg71ht37iw9Wqf4es8Q&oe=6A58D725"}, "display_name": "House of the Butcher", "keywords": ["horror", "shooter", "quest", "puzzle", "evil"], "long_description": "House of the Butcher is a virtual reality escape the room style game with shooter elements. \nOne day while camping, you discover a killer. Trying to escape, you find yourself in his lair. You have to search for items, solve puzzles and find a way out while the butcher is hunting you. Don't let him get close by shooting him or using your axe. \nYour main task is to survive at any cost.\n\nKey Features\n- Support Oculus Quest 2 & 3\n- Two types of weapons\n- Many different puzzles\n- Free Movement\n- Smooth motion and framerate\n", "short_description": "House of the Butcher is a virtual reality escape the room style game with shooter elements."}]}, "developer_name": "Yurii Kaplunov", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://raptorsreality.com/privacypolicy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Raptor`s Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://raptorsreality.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "CO